        "id": 361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-08T13:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we use ‘notifier’ or ‘event dispatcher’ instead of ‘bridge’ in this API’s names? In VPP, ‘bridge’ strongly suggests L2 bridging or bridge domains, whereas this component dispatches BFD notifications between in-process modules. A name such as `bfd_vnet_notifier` would make the role clearer.",
      "revId": "b3a02c176563d27e66bb1de27c3a74fca66b1381",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
